{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/signifyd95/jobs/7913439","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"education":"education_optional","internal_job_id":3440231,"location":{"name":"United States (Remote);"},"metadata":null,"id":7913439,"updated_at":"2026-08-12T23:20:13-04:00","requisition_id":null,"title":"Senior Implementation Manager","pay_input_ranges":[],"company_name":"Signifyd","first_published":"2026-05-13T17:48:44-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;content-intro\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;At Signifyd, we help merchants confidently grow their businesses by building trusted relationships with their customers. Our advanced technology, combined with a team genuinely invested in our clients’ success, creates frictionless shopping experiences, approving more good orders, protecting revenue, and keeping customers happy.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Trusted by thousands of leading merchants across more than 100 countries, we securely process billions of transactions each year. Our people are the heart of everything we do, driving our mission forward with commitment, empathy, and creativity. Join us on our mission to empower confident, fraud-free commerce by helping online retailers provide superior customer experiences and eliminate fraud. Learn about our company values \u0026lt;a href=\u0026quot;https://www.signifyd.com/about/#values\u0026quot;\u0026gt;here\u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;!\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Department:\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt; Solutions Design and Delivery\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;As a Sr. Implementation Manager within the Solutions Design \u0026amp;amp; Delivery team, you own the complete technical relationship for our Enterprise and Strategic merchants from technical win through go-live. You pick up the technical relationship the Solutions Architect built during pre-sales and carry it forward, becoming the merchant\u0026#39;s primary technical point of contact for the full integration. While your work is predominantly post-sale, you may support pre-sales technical validation on select deals when needed. You will work cross-functionally across Risk, Product, Sales, and Customer Success to ensure timely integrations that also result in a positive merchant experience, and you will build strong working relationships within the merchant\u0026#39;s platform and engineering teams.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;h2\u0026gt;Responsibilities\u0026lt;/h2\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Technical Ownership \u0026amp;amp; Delivery\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Validate the technical design and data requirements defined during pre-sales, partnering with the Solutions Architect to make sure nothing gets lost in the handoff from what was proposed to what gets built.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Own finalization of a technical design that both the merchant and Signifyd agree on, resolving any open questions or gaps before implementation work begins.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Lead the merchant\u0026#39;s technical team or SI through design, development, and testing, no matter the platform, industry, or business model. You set the pace, catch problems early, and keep both sides aligned on what \u0026quot;done\u0026quot; looks like at each phase.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Bring hands-on familiarity with API integrations and common ecommerce platforms such as Magento, Salesforce, and Shopify, along with the judgment to apply that knowledge to whatever stack a merchant is actually running.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Own timely delivery of key integration milestones. Every integration looks different; milestones may include defining success criteria and confirming those criteria have been met.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Communication \u0026amp;amp; Cross-Functional Partnership\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Communicate integration status across the full project team, merchant and internal, with regular report-outs that keep everyone clear on dates, risks and mitigation plans, and the overall approach, especially when an integration spans multiple phases.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Flag proactively when a business sponsor or C-suite relationship needs Signifyd leadership involved, and brief them so they can engage credibly.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Keep a clean onboarding portfolio with regular, transparent updates in CRM.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Collaborate with internal Signifyd teams to swiftly escalate and resolve integration roadblocks, communicating resolution to internal stakeholders and merchants alike.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Work cross-functionally to keep improving the onboarding experience, partnering with Risk, Product, Engineering, Sales, and Customer Success.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Treat Risk as an internal client: deliver the outcomes the merchant expects while giving Data Science the planning and data they need to hit those expectations.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Spot when a new, novel, or edge-case merchant need is really an opportunity to extend a feature or API integration, and treat it as a growth lever, not a one-off fix.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Team \u0026amp;amp; Process Impact\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Understand Signifyd\u0026#39;s implementation methodology well enough to build on it, not just follow it. Improve it, streamline it, and help institutionalize the practices that make the team faster and more efficient without sacrificing quality, risk management, or the merchant relationship.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Contribute to a culture of shared knowledge. We don\u0026#39;t require strict adherence to process. We ask that you show up for the team: share what you\u0026#39;re learning, document what works, and help the next person skip the problem you already solved.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Become a subject matter expert whose knowledge strengthens the team and the business, not just your own book of work.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Embody a genuinely collaborative culture. This team runs on people covering for each other. When someone\u0026#39;s slammed, the team steps in to lighten the load. When you have capacity, you check in, offer help, and pick up what you can. We rely on each other because when one of us is out, the implementation doesn\u0026#39;t stop.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Onboard new team members as their buddy, supporting their first merchant conversations and helping them build the technical skills an integration requires.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;h2\u0026gt;Skills \u0026amp;amp; Experience\u0026lt;/h2\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Experience\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;8+ years of complex technical implementation and/or solutions delivery experience, including direct experience working with Top 1000 Retailers.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Demonstrated passion for ecommerce or technology services.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Background in payments, fintech, or fraud (bonus, not necessary).\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Skills\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Project management experience/certification\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Clear understanding of API terminology (e.g., GET, POST, PUT, JSON, Webhook, Listeners) and tools (e.g., Postman, GitHub, etc.).\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Ability to work quickly and efficiently with tools such as Looker, Monday, Salesforce, Claude, Gemini, Google Sheets/Excel, and SQL.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Excellent written communication and presentation skills, with the ability to shift comfortably between operational, technical, and C-suite conversations.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Resourceful, detail-oriented when needed, highly organized, and creative.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Self-starter who thrives under ambiguity in a fast-paced, deadline-oriented environment.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Python fluency (bonus).\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;#LI-Remote\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Benefits in our US offices:\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Discretionary Time Off Policy (Unlimited!)\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;401K Match\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Stock Options\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Annual Performance Bonus or Commissions\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Paid Parental Leave (12 weeks)\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;On-Demand Therapy for all employees \u0026amp;amp; their dependents\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Dedicated learning budget through Learnerbly\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Health Insurance\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Dental Insurance\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Vision Insurance\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Flexible Spending Account (FSA)\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Short Term and Long Term Disability Insurance\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Life Insurance\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Company Social Events\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Signifyd Swag\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Compensation:\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;em\u0026gt;In the United States, each work location is assigned a specific pay zone, which determines the salary range for a given position. The starting base salary for the selected candidate will be based on a variety of factors, including job-related skills, experience, qualifications, geographic location, and current market conditions.\u0026lt;/em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Base Salary Range:\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;$140,000– $175,000 annually\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Bonus: \u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;This role is eligible for an annual performance bonus of up to 10% of base salary.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-weight: 400;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;We want to provide an inclusive interview experience for all, including people with disabilities. We are happy to provide reasonable accommodations to candidates in need of individualized support during the\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;span class=\u0026quot;c-mrkdwn__highlight\u0026quot;\u0026gt;hiring\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;process.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;content-conclusion\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;a href=\u0026quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HSnMY6HGjB1FNRX4Ez9bUre5mrPPcHIq/view?usp=sharing\u0026quot; target=\u0026quot;_blank\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Signifyd\u0026#39;s Applicant Privacy Notice\u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;","departments":[{"id":217062,"name":"Solutions Engineering","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":66460,"name":"USA","location":null,"child_ids":[66462,66464,66463],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null,"compliance":null,"demographic_questions":{"header":"Signifyd US Candidate Demographic Questions","description":"\u003cp\u003eSignifyd is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are fully committed to creating an inclusive, safe environment for all candidates and employees. Candidate demographic data in the aggregate provides a wealth of information that we can use to assess progress against our diversity and inclusion goals and identify areas we can do better. By answering these demographic questions, you are helping Signifyd become a more inclusive place for all of us to do our best work!\u003c/p\u003e","questions":[{"id":1483,"label":"What is your gender?","required":true,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":8393,"label":"Man","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8394,"label":"Woman","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8395,"label":"Non-binary/third gender","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8478,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":true},{"id":8397,"label":"Prefer to self-describe as","free_form":true,"decline_to_answer":false}]},{"id":1484,"label":"What is your race/ethnic group?","required":true,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":8398,"label":"American Indian or Alaskan Native","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8399,"label":"Asian","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8400,"label":"Black or African American","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8401,"label":"Hispanic or Latino","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8402,"label":"White","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8403,"label":"Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8404,"label":"Two or More Races","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8479,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":true},{"id":8406,"label":"Prefer to self-describe as","free_form":true,"decline_to_answer":false}]},{"id":1486,"label":"What is your highest level of school you have completed or the highest degree you have received?","required":true,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":8414,"label":"Less than high school degree","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8415,"label":"High school degree or equivalent (e.g., GED)","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8416,"label":"Some college but no degree","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8417,"label":"Associate degree","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8418,"label":"Bachelor degree","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8419,"label":"Graduate degree","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8480,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":true}]},{"id":1487,"label":"Which of the following categories best describes your employment status?","required":true,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":8420,"label":"Full-time employment","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8421,"label":"Part-time employment","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8422,"label":"Unemployed","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8423,"label":"Self-employed","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8424,"label":"Homemaker","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8425,"label":"Student","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8426,"label":"Retired","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8427,"label":"Other","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8481,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":true}]},{"id":1494,"label":"What is your Veteran status?","required":true,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":8472,"label":"I am not a protected veteran","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8473,"label":"I identify as a veteran","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8482,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":true}]},{"id":1495,"label":"Do you consider yourself to have a disability?","required":true,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":8475,"label":"Yes, I have a disability, or have a history/record of having a disability","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8476,"label":"No, I don't have a disability, or a history/record of having a disability","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":8483,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":true}]}]},"questions":[{"description":null,"label":"First Name","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"first_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Last Name","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"last_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Email","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"email","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Phone","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"phone","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Resume/CV","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"resume","type":"input_file","values":[]},{"name":"resume_text","type":"textarea","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Cover Letter","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"cover_letter","type":"input_file","values":[]},{"name":"cover_letter_text","type":"textarea","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"What is your preferred name?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_66736835","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"LinkedIn Profile","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"question_66736836","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"How did you hear about this job?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_66736837","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"LinkedIn","value":713103591},{"label":"Indeed","value":713103592},{"label":"Glassdoor","value":713103593},{"label":"Built In","value":713103594},{"label":"Employee Referral","value":713103595},{"label":"Signifyd Website","value":713103596},{"label":"Other","value":713103597}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Are you legally authorized to work in the United States?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_66736838","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Yes","value":1},{"label":"No","value":0}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Are you on any kind of work visa currently?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_66736839","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Yes","value":1},{"label":"No","value":0}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Will you now or in the future require employer sponsorship to work in the United States? (Examples include: H-1B, TN, E-3, O-1, OPT, CPT, or any other employment authorization requiring employer sponsorship, including a STEM OPT I-983 Extension.)","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_66736840","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Yes","value":1},{"label":"No","value":0}]}]},{"description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eWhat are personal pronouns?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePersonal pronouns are the pronouns that other individuals would use to refer to you. You can select multiple sets of pronouns.\u003c/p\u003e","label":"We care about addressing everyone correctly. Share your personal pronouns with the hiring team if you'd like.","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"question_66736841[]","type":"multi_value_multi_select","values":[{"label":"she/her/hers","value":713103598},{"label":"he/him/his","value":713103599},{"label":"they/them/theirs","value":713103600}]}]}],"location_questions":[{"description":null,"label":"Longitude","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"longitude","type":"input_hidden","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Latitude","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"latitude","type":"input_hidden","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Location","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"location","type":"input_text","values":[]}]}]}